  "contentHtml": "<P>\r\n<TABLE border=0 cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 width=\"100%\">\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=30 width=100 align=center><IMG src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fbrd_title.gif\"></TD>\r\n<TD bgColor=#ededed width=1></TD>\r\n<TD colSpan=9 align=center>2011 NSTA national conference 발표</TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD bgColor=#e7e7e7 height=1 width=100 colSpan=11></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=30 width=100 align=center><IMG src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fbrd_name.gif\"></TD>\r\n<TD bgColor=#ededed width=1></TD>\r\n<TD align=center>김영학</TD>\r\n<TD bgColor=#ededed width=1></TD>\r\n<TD height=30 width=100 align=center><IMG src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fbrd_date.gif\"></TD>\r\n<TD bgColor=#ededed width=1></TD>\r\n<TD width=100 align=center>2010-12-10</TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>3월에 냈던 application이 통과되어 <BR><BR>2011년 NSTA national conference에서 발표를 하게 되었습니다.<BR><BR>미국에서 하고 싶었던 일이 이루어져서 기쁘구요.<BR><BR><BR></P>\r\n<P style=\"MARGIN: 5px 0px; WIDTH: 100%\"><A id=thumb_09275443699986204 class=imageUtil href=\"http://www.sedu21.com/UpLoadIMG/WfGSmFj7G5ZA5C3vwZ3QFqPLUr.jpg\" target=_blank><IMG id=image_09275443699986204 border=0 alt=\"\" src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fwww.sedu21.com%2FUpLoadIMG%2FWfGSmFj7G5ZA5C3vwZ3QFqPLUr.jpg\" width=800 height=600></A></P>\r\n<P><BR>샌프란시스코 가서 좋은 과학교육 정보도 얻고 선생님들과 많은 교류하고 오겠습니다.<BR><BR><BR>고맙습니다.</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>------------------------------------------------------------------------</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>\r\n<TABLE border=0 cellSpacing=0 cellPadding=0 width=\"100%\">\r\n<TBODY>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=30 width=100 align=center><IMG src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fbrd_title.gif\"></TD>\r\n<TD bgColor=#ededed width=1></TD>\r\n<TD colSpan=9 align=center>My session broucher</TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD bgColor=#e7e7e7 height=1 width=100 colSpan=11></TD></TR>\r\n<TR>\r\n<TD height=30 width=100 align=center><IMG src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fbrd_name.gif\"></TD>\r\n<TD bgColor=#ededed width=1></TD>\r\n<TD align=center>김영학</TD>\r\n<TD bgColor=#ededed width=1></TD>\r\n<TD height=30 width=100 align=center><IMG src=\"https://img1.daumcdn.net/relay/cafe/original/?fname=http%3A%2F%2Fsedu21.com%2Fimages%2Fbrd_date.gif\"></TD>\r\n<TD bgColor=#ededed width=1></TD>\r\n<TD width=100 align=center>2011-03-05</TD></TR></TBODY></TABLE></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>This is my session broucher.<BR><BR>Thank-you. </P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DAM6%26dataid%3D46%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20140119163046&url=http%3A%2F%2Fcfile291.uf.daum.net%2Fattach%2F262B164152DB85540D3459')\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/daumtop_deco/icon/icon.hanmail.net/editor/p_word_s.gif?rv=1.0.1\" border=\"0\" alt=\"첨부파일\" class=\"vam\"/> Silent Movie Broucher(YoungHak Kim).docx</a></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------</P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P>I have attached the presentation movie clip file.<BR>Enjoy it!<BR><BR><BR>2011년 NSTA conference 발표 동영상입니다.<BR><BR>발표 주제는 무성영화를 활용한 과학탐구 활동이었고,<BR><BR>첨부한 동영상은 발표의 후반부인 <BR>The Importnace of Communication and Sharing Ideas에 <BR>대한 내용입니다.<BR><BR><BR>규리가 동영상을 보면서 <BR>아빠 발음이 왜 그래? 왜 더듬대면서 말을 해?<BR><BR>규리야, 반기문 사무총장님이 인터뷰하는 것 봤지? <BR>영어 발음도 중요하지만 의사소통에 문제만 없으면 된단다. ^ ^<BR><BR><BR>하여간 남은 기간 동안 영어의사소통 능력 향상을 위해 더 열심히 노력해야 겠습니다.<BR><BR>고맙습니다.<BR><BR></P>\r\n<P>&nbsp;</P>\r\n<P><BR></P>\r\n<iframe width=\"640\" height=\"360\" src=\"//www.youtube.com/embed/9_r5IzWzNes?feature=player_detailpage\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
